    {
      "source": "<a href=\"WildcardIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndex</code></a> is a specific <a href=\"Index.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>Index</code></a> that can be used to include all fields into an index based on the\n<code>$**\" : 1</code> pattern on a root object (the one typically carrying the\n<a href=\"../mapping/Document.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>Document</code></a> annotation). On those it is possible to use\n<a href=\"#wildcardProjectionInclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionInclude(String...)</code></a> and <a href=\"#wildcardProjectionExclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionExclude(String...)</code></a> to define specific\npaths for in-/exclusion.\n<br/>\nIt can also be used to define an index on a specific field path and its subfields, e.g.\n<code>\"path.to.field.$**\" : 1</code>. <br/>\nNote that wildcardProjections are not allowed in this case.\n<br/>\n<strong>LIMITATIONS</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#unique()\"><code>Unique</code></a> and <a href=\"#expire(long)\"><code>ttl</code></a> options are not supported.</li>\n<li>Keys used for sharding must not be included</li>\n<li>Cannot be used to generate any type of geo index.</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<code>WildcardIndex</code> 是一种特定的 <code>Index</code>，可用于基于根对象（通常带有 <code>Document</code> 注解的对象）上的 <code>$**\" : 1</code> 模式将所有字段包含到索引中。在此类索引上，可以使用 <code>wildcardProjectionInclude(String...)</code> 和 <code>wildcardProjectionExclude(String...)</code> 来定义特定路径的包含/排除规则。\n<br/>\n它也可用于在特定字段路径及其子字段上定义索引，例如 <code>\"path.to.field.$**\" : 1</code>。<br/>\n请注意，在此情况下不允许使用通配符投影（wildcardProjections）。\n<br/>\n<strong>限制条件</strong><br/>\n<ul>\n<li>不支持 <a href=\"#unique()\"><code>Unique</code></a> 和 <a href=\"#expire(long)\"><code>ttl</code></a> 选项。</li>\n<li>不能包含用于分片的键。</li>\n<li>无法用于生成任何类型的地理空间索引。</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"WildcardIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndex</code></a> for the given path. If no path is provided the\nindex will be considered a root one using <code>$**</code>. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> <a href=\"#wildcardProjectionInclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionInclude(String...)</code></a>, <a href=\"#wildcardProjectionExclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionExclude(String...)</code></a>\ncan only be used for top level index definitions having an empty or null path.",
      "translation": "为给定路径创建一个新的<a href=\"WildcardIndex.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.index\"><code>WildcardIndex</code></a>实例。如果未提供路径，则索引将被视为根索引，使用<code>$**</code>。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong><a href=\"#wildcardProjectionInclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionInclude(String...)</code></a>和<a href=\"#wildcardProjectionExclude(java.lang.String...)\"><code>wildcardProjectionExclude(String...)</code></a>仅可用于具有空或 null 路径的顶层索引定义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Add fields to be included from indexing via <code>wildcardProjection</code>. <br/>\nThis option is only allowed on <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\"><code>top level</code></a> wildcard indexes.",
      "translation": "通过 <code>wildcardProjection</code> 添加索引中包含的字段。<br/>\n此选项仅允许用于 <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\"><code>顶层</code></a> 通配符索引。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Add fields to be excluded from indexing via <code>wildcardProjection</code>. <br/>\nThis option is only allowed on <a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\"><code>top level</code></a> wildcard indexes.",
      "translation": "通过 `<code>wildcardProjection</code>` 添加不应被索引的字段。<br/>\n此选项仅允许用于<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E()\"><code>顶层</code></a>通配符索引。",
      "count": 1
